      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "All three requirements must be met: (1) employed by the employer for at least 12 months, (2) employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding leave commencement, and (3) employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite.",
