      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:fb90909e83844ef0cd3ac23003cf8af814d6b552666944c8d73402b7d12951a1\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:bedc9b4f8f0c9b4196e631f36aa155c3c73032d6d47172b0d4a1a53d326e3ab0\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:387729cfce8532e73ed94702f06e06420441fa570df51d939242835ad11918be\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4fb3dbbe00a1b6bac7ce152a234769378794013fd9a0c23e9dbc48307a5dd3af\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:e8ea3b443a922c824e5cff2727047fef2072b4ac9ab613c3957f82352a8e6ae6\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:fca7601349ff4fc061e5a5c11704438b2bd9a74c49760ee93d5b48eafdd22819\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a9ffd8f4602f6264f42a988d13d4fea4d673325620b566c54ccb91ffc22e6d32\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:855b06e94ed3d8de40a0a83b281409c69ec65e47d67ae129760c2b97562e1348\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:18a15ba419ade0a325f62958d17d519f42ad585fbe24efdc61fdb1fa0b3f13b0\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"choice_text\":\"All three requirements must be met: (1) employed by the employer for at least 12 months, (2) employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding leave commencement, and (3) employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"29 CFR 825.110 — Eligible employee.\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":590,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":103,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:103:sha256-f65766fc8c1d9018ff7f6a685d59a802898d9b888c3de0a8c3c4756b5c8959a4\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":35,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:0:35:sha256-cdba565171941ded4034f74b1980d94e626fe3b38491ebf5285ac9ba0f59d68b\",\"quote\":\"29 CFR 825.110 — Eligible employee.\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":170,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:105:170:sha256-65892c2f4a4b04b4af78de1dd2934ed6701e42ce507cd493e35ac4d9a1ba80b0\",\"quote\":\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"start\":105},{\"end\":406,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:172:406:sha256-f8c620c940dc57284f54426aad3bc219080834d541b71563d59c69ce9eeffe60\",\"quote\":\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"start\":172},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:408:590:sha256-eb912ba3e3b8c4d1913a4740159f38d60c23793adb2467a188d1d44e8220b6ca\",\"quote\":\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":408}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:89d6d58a1797f50321599a403f6581fb434a09a5b272392cbdbe64dd05110d4a\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"logic_text\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:18a15ba419ade0a325f62958d17d519f42ad585fbe24efdc61fdb1fa0b3f13b0\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:6e0ce056ff4a5a6ee41fb53763d89c1f657a0632273ab48c6256f45fc3c165f1\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"references\":[\"§ 825.801\",\"§ 825.105(b)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:c5e978eeec0bc45ecf812abbffb021d20c6e4763c01739ad49addd300a7a5b10\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\"],\"scope_text\":\"Applies to an employee of a covered employer seeking to be an eligible employee under the FMLA.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":37,\"summary\":\"An eligible employee is defined as an employee of a covered employer who has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave (subject to special rules for airline flight crew employees in § 825.801), and is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite (referencing § 825.105(b) for employees working outside the U.S.).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
